ix Multiplication Exponent ω Measures\n\nWhy does one matrix entry take three multiplications here? To compute the top-left entry, pair the first row of A with the first column of B: 1×9, 2×6, and 3×3, then add the results. For an n×n product, there are n² output https://t.co/PKmfnZbWBM", "url": "https://x.com/mathify_dev/status/2116651713499115817"}, {"author_id": "1619657658432389120", "created_at": "2026-10-31T21:40:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116646623317271016"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/vt1Ofvp3NB", "end": 292, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/samstar71_/status/2116646623317271016/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116646613037068288", "start": 269, "url": "https://t.co/vt1Ofvp3NB"}, {"display_url": "x.com/samstar71_/sta…", "end": 316, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/samstar71_/status/2116215156577542645", "start": 293, "url": "https://t.co/rtn65Tr0kb"}]}, "id": "2116646623317271016", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 161, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116215156577542645", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "【 THE FUTURE OF DECENTRALIZED AI INFRASTRUCTURE 】\n\nBuilding beyond centralized intelligence.\n\n«“Decentralizing AI isn't just about distributing models. It's about distributing the infrastructure that allows intelligent systems to work together.”»\n\nImagine thousands of https://t.co/vt1Ofvp3NB https://t.co/rtn65Tr0kb", "url": "https://x.com/samstar71_/status/2116646623317271016"}, {"author_id": "94877778", "created_at": "2026-10-31T21:00:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116636526717374892"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/OWumO55qwR", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/MisterSnowCrash/status/2116636526717374892/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116636186097897472", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/OWumO55qwR"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/OWumO55qwR", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/MisterSnowC